{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"746","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Green and Black Tea"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Innokentiy likes tea very much and today he wants to drink exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" cups of tea. He would be happy to drink more but he had exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" tea bags, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" of them are green and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" are black."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Innokentiy doesn't like to drink the same tea (green or black) more than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" times in a row. Your task is to determine the order of brewing tea bags so that Innokentiy will be able to drink "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" cups of tea, without drinking the same tea more than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" times in a row, or to inform that it is impossible. Each tea bag has to be used exactly once."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains four integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k ≤ n ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ a, b ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of cups of tea Innokentiy wants to drink, the maximum number of cups of same tea he can drink in a row, the number of tea bags of green and black tea. It is guaranteed that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a + b = n"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If it is impossible to drink "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" cups of tea, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Otherwise, print the string of the length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", which consists of characters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'. If some character equals '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', then the corresponding cup of tea should be green. If some character equals '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', then the corresponding cup of tea should be black."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are multiple answers, print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 1 3 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"GBGBG\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7 2 2 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"BBGBGBB"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 3 4 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"NO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"746D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/746/problem/D"}